1
00:00:58,270 --> 00:00:59,850
I love you.

2
00:01:02,340 --> 00:01:06,100
Yoo Jung, keep the secret please.

3
00:01:42,710 --> 00:01:46,460
My boyfriend would be wrongfully accused of committing hit-and-run.

4
00:01:46,460 --> 00:01:49,340
I said I was driving the car, anyway.

5
00:01:49,340 --> 00:01:56,460
So please help my lover.

6
00:02:00,870 --> 00:02:05,440
I heard that he love her more than himself.

7
00:02:05,990 --> 00:02:07,110
You are the prosecutor of this case

8
00:02:07,110 --> 00:02:09,020
so you must comprehend it a lot.

9
00:02:09,020 --> 00:02:14,760
It's said she died as a pregnant woman.

10
00:02:27,600 --> 00:02:29,970
Kang Yoo Jung will receive the severest punishment.

11
00:02:29,970 --> 00:02:34,350
I won't let my personal relationships affect my judgement.

12
00:02:34,350 --> 00:02:36,140
It isn't that case.

13
00:02:38,880 --> 00:02:44,780
What I want is to make sure that laws are fully applied.

14
00:03:19,520 --> 00:03:24,030
Love? That's the only thing you want?

15
00:03:24,030 --> 00:03:25,800
Ah, it is so pretty.

16
00:03:29,190 --> 00:03:30,510
Sure.

17
00:03:30,510 --> 00:03:31,860
You are lying.

18
00:03:31,860 --> 00:03:34,770
If I'm lying, why am I with you?

19
00:03:34,770 --> 00:03:36,760
Why are you with me, then?

20
00:03:36,760 --> 00:03:39,470
Is that really important?

21
00:03:40,050 --> 00:03:42,090
It looks good on you.

22
00:03:42,090 --> 00:03:43,620
It means a lot to me.

23
00:03:43,620 --> 00:03:44,830
What's wrong with you today?

24
00:03:44,830 --> 00:03:47,290
I want my boy tell me that "I love you".

25
00:03:47,290 --> 00:03:48,950
Is that wrong?

26
00:03:48,950 --> 00:03:50,700
Hey! Ji Hee!

27
00:03:53,730 --> 00:03:55,620
Ji Hee!

28
00:03:57,880 --> 00:04:00,920
Ji Hee! I get it. I love you.

29
00:04:02,140 --> 00:04:03,980
I say I love you.

30
00:04:08,140 --> 00:04:09,350
I love you.

31
00:04:19,380 --> 00:04:20,980
You know me, right?

32
00:04:21,980 --> 00:04:24,840
Min Hyuk has an eye for girls.

33
00:04:24,840 --> 00:04:28,380
Be nice to him. He's emotionally fragile.

34
00:04:29,780 --> 00:04:31,160
Okay.

35
00:04:31,480 --> 00:04:32,910
You have to dump this pretty lady

36
00:04:32,910 --> 00:04:34,590
to accept the marriage settled by your father.

37
00:04:34,590 --> 00:04:37,130
You must be upset. Am I right?

38
00:04:37,130 --> 00:04:38,640
Madam!

39
00:04:39,050 --> 00:04:42,580
Why? You have not be frank to her yet?

40
00:04:47,620 --> 00:04:50,530
- Ji Hee! - Let her go if you can not give her a promise.

41
00:04:55,370 --> 00:04:57,530
She is chic.

42
00:04:57,900 --> 00:05:00,060
If she's scared of me,

43
00:05:00,060 --> 00:05:03,580
how can she handle your father?

44
00:05:03,580 --> 00:05:04,560
Do not ruin the life of a young lady

45
00:05:04,560 --> 00:05:07,940
for your own selfishness.

46
00:05:31,020 --> 00:05:33,290
Why take it so seriouslyï¼Ÿ

47
00:05:34,730 --> 00:05:37,010
Just be your father's good boy.

48
00:05:37,010 --> 00:05:38,620
Congressmen Shin holds the absolute authority.

49
00:05:38,620 --> 00:05:41,110
Nothing could stop him.

50
00:05:41,110 --> 00:05:44,100
Your father never accept no-good trades.

51
00:05:44,100 --> 00:05:46,860
I'm not in the mood for this kind of crap.

52
00:05:47,080 --> 00:05:52,050
As for Se Yeon, buy her if you need; sell her if not.

53
00:05:52,050 --> 00:05:55,200
That's called mergers and acquisitions.

54
00:05:55,200 --> 00:05:57,000
Marriage is the same case.

55
00:05:57,000 --> 00:06:00,170
Will you be happy if marry your wife like that?

56
00:06:00,170 --> 00:06:03,080
Idiot! Is happiness important?

57
00:06:04,000 --> 00:06:06,570
Seo Ji Hee, is that the name?

58
00:06:06,570 --> 00:06:09,070
You shouldn't have taken her seriously.

59
00:06:09,610 --> 00:06:12,210
If you have dumped her earlier, she would not be so heart-broken.

60
00:06:12,210 --> 00:06:13,420
How dare you...

61
00:06:13,420 --> 00:06:15,330
Girls are everywhere.

62
00:06:15,330 --> 00:06:16,490
Shut up.

63
00:06:16,490 --> 00:06:18,120
Look at you!

64
00:06:18,120 --> 00:06:19,770
Why did you fall for a cheap girl like that

65
00:06:19,770 --> 00:06:22,230
and put yourself in this mess?

66
00:06:22,900 --> 00:06:25,830
Hey! What are you doing? Asshole!

67
00:06:25,830 --> 00:06:27,050
How dare you talk like that?

68
00:06:27,050 --> 00:06:31,970
You, you bastard!

69
00:06:31,970 --> 00:06:33,960
Let me go!

70
00:06:33,960 --> 00:06:37,350
Asshole!

71
00:06:39,340 --> 00:06:42,860
Hey! Be a grown man, Jo Min Hyuk!

72
00:06:42,860 --> 00:06:45,290
Loser, you couldn't even protect your own girl.

73
00:06:45,290 --> 00:06:47,600
- Let me go! - Hey hey hey!

74
00:06:47,600 --> 00:06:51,910
Asshole! God damn asshole! Let me go!

75
00:06:53,640 --> 00:06:58,740
He still couldn't pull himself together?

76
00:06:59,760 --> 00:07:03,610
Chairman, why don't you leave him alone this time?

77
00:07:03,610 --> 00:07:05,080
What?

78
00:07:07,040 --> 00:07:09,500
He is a young man now,

79
00:07:10,570 --> 00:07:13,630
yet I haven't given him good lessons.

80
00:07:14,360 --> 00:07:17,430
Whenever he cried over a broken toy,

81
00:07:17,430 --> 00:07:20,240
I always got him a new one,

82
00:07:21,330 --> 00:07:25,020
instead of snatching all his toys away.

83
00:07:28,190 --> 00:07:29,950
Gwang Min!

84
00:07:29,950 --> 00:07:31,160
Yes, chairman.

85
00:07:31,160 --> 00:07:35,510
Stop giving him any support.

86
00:07:35,510 --> 00:07:36,350
Sorry?

87
00:07:36,350 --> 00:07:38,870
He'll not realize how lucky he has been

88
00:07:38,870 --> 00:07:42,400
until loses everything.

89
00:07:42,890 --> 00:07:45,410
What kind of losing do you think is unbearable for him?

90
00:07:45,410 --> 00:07:48,560
What kind of losing do you think is unbearable for him?

91
00:07:49,160 --> 00:07:51,440
What do you mean I can't sell it?

92
00:07:51,440 --> 00:07:54,330
Because you are the most powerful shareful stockholder of Highland,

93
00:07:54,330 --> 00:07:56,950
so you are prohibited from selling the stocks in your own name.

94
00:07:56,950 --> 00:07:59,860
Even though they're mine?

95
00:07:59,860 --> 00:08:04,220
Without the permission of the board, the trade is invalid.

96
00:08:55,800 --> 00:08:59,570
I'm Ahn Do Hoon, the prosecutor of this case.

97
00:09:03,010 --> 00:09:05,510
In accordance with the Telecommunications Act,

98
00:09:05,930 --> 00:09:09,140
all the conversations will be recorded from now.

99
00:09:14,130 --> 00:09:19,180
Your name is Kang Yoo Jung and you were born on July 20th, 1984.

100
00:09:19,640 --> 00:09:25,290
You live in No. 21 Samseon-dong, Seongbuk-gu, right?

101
00:09:26,650 --> 00:09:27,840
Yes.

102
00:09:28,490 --> 00:09:31,470
You are entitled to appoint an attorney.

103
00:09:31,470 --> 00:09:34,510
Do you want one?

104
00:09:34,510 --> 00:09:41,760
No, I am good.

105
00:09:46,130 --> 00:09:51,240
Between 10 p.m. and 11 p.m. on the night of 23rd,

106
00:09:51,240 --> 00:09:55,930
were you driving on National Road No.8?

107
00:09:56,850 --> 00:09:57,970
I was.

108
00:09:57,970 --> 00:09:59,750
Ms. Kang Yoo Jung.

109
00:10:05,590 --> 00:10:08,270
You have to tell me nothing but the truth here.

110
00:10:10,480 --> 00:10:15,390
It's not too late. Let's tell the truth.

111
00:10:17,060 --> 00:10:19,800
Look! Look!

112
00:10:19,800 --> 00:10:23,370
We've asked all the questions already. Why does he bother to interrogate again?

113
00:10:23,370 --> 00:10:27,270
He should make her plead guilty here.

114
00:10:27,270 --> 00:10:31,220
He's a newbie. Let's wait and see.

115
00:10:31,220 --> 00:10:34,720
She's the guilty one, sir.

116
00:10:34,720 --> 00:10:38,940
I can tell the guilty guys by just one glance into their eyes.

117
00:10:38,940 --> 00:10:43,900
Their eyes would never lie.

118
00:10:43,900 --> 00:10:46,050
Innocent guys would never look away.

119
00:10:46,050 --> 00:10:49,090
Only dishonest ones can't bear direct eye contacts.

120
00:10:49,090 --> 00:10:50,970
Look! Look! Look at her.

121
00:10:50,970 --> 00:10:54,050
She can't look into his eyes. She dares not.

122
00:10:59,070 --> 00:11:07,000
Again. Were you really driving the car?

123
00:11:11,500 --> 00:11:16,600
Yes. I was.

124
00:11:23,670 --> 00:11:27,290
Anyway, you will be back soon.

125
00:11:27,290 --> 00:11:30,220
Just save our troubles by staying around.

126
00:11:31,750 --> 00:11:34,890
Chief. It's unfortunate that the victims were dead,

127
00:11:34,890 --> 00:11:38,750
yet it's reasonable to doubt that

128
00:11:38,750 --> 00:11:40,240
the girl isn't the infringer.

129
00:11:40,240 --> 00:11:41,540
Rather than charge her in haste, why can we wait and see...

130
00:11:41,540 --> 00:11:43,070
What's your point?

131
00:11:43,070 --> 00:11:46,830
The defendat wasn't aware of the accident.

132
00:11:46,830 --> 00:11:50,060
The defendat fixed the blood-stained car before runnng away.

133
00:11:50,060 --> 00:11:52,800
What makes you believe that she wasn't aware of the accident?

134
00:11:52,800 --> 00:11:55,830
-The suspect is... -You're the prosecutor.

135
00:11:55,830 --> 00:11:59,580
You have to look at the facts instead of one-sided stories of a suspect.

136
00:11:59,580 --> 00:12:02,530
If you want to defend her against all the evidence,

137
00:12:02,530 --> 00:12:04,480
to be her attorney.

138
00:12:06,730 --> 00:12:11,970
I heard you received a Chief Juetice Award at the graduate ceremony of academy.

139
00:12:11,970 --> 00:12:13,130
I did.

140
00:12:13,130 --> 00:12:17,010
Hundreds of officials behind you are waiting to be promoted.

141
00:12:17,010 --> 00:12:19,640
If I put them in charge of the case,

142
00:12:19,640 --> 00:12:21,980
do you think they would come to me like you?

143
00:12:28,150 --> 00:12:29,770
The police have found all the evidence and submitted the charges.

144
00:12:29,770 --> 00:12:33,940
If you cann't handle it, leave here.

145
00:12:34,300 --> 00:12:36,550
Seek an arrest warrant right away.

146
00:12:47,250 --> 00:12:50,240
Waiting for what? Hop in!

147
00:13:18,260 --> 00:13:23,690
Hey. How is your day? Want something to eat?

148
00:13:25,550 --> 00:13:27,190
Daddy!

149
00:13:27,190 --> 00:13:29,140
Why being so sticky.

150
00:13:29,140 --> 00:13:33,140
Your daughter is leaving for Japan. Isn't it cool?

151
00:13:33,490 --> 00:13:36,430
Really? When?

152
00:13:36,430 --> 00:13:38,990
Maybe this week if nothing stops me. Yet I have to wait until everything is settled.

153
00:13:38,990 --> 00:13:42,440
This week? What did Do Hoon say?

154
00:13:42,440 --> 00:13:48,500
He supports me of course. We can marry after my return.

155
00:13:48,570 --> 00:13:50,570
Is there something wrong between you?

156
00:13:50,570 --> 00:13:54,030
No. Nothing is wrong.

157
00:13:54,030 --> 00:13:56,870
Anyway, you should close your store and date with me tomorrow.

158
00:13:56,870 --> 00:14:00,350
Is that clear?

159
00:14:02,280 --> 00:14:06,730
Do you have to wander around just before your marriage?

160
00:14:06,730 --> 00:14:08,750
Are your in-laws okay with it?

161
00:14:08,750 --> 00:14:11,470
Don't be silly. People aren't that conservative at this year.

162
00:14:11,720 --> 00:14:14,760
Have they talked about dowary?

163
00:14:14,760 --> 00:14:16,180
Don't keep all that troubles to yourself.

164
00:14:16,180 --> 00:14:17,730
If you need anything, let me know.

165
00:14:17,730 --> 00:14:20,030
As I said, everything is fine.

166
00:14:24,860 --> 00:14:29,040
What? What did you say? I would rat on you?

167
00:14:29,040 --> 00:14:30,620
My son's a prosecutor.

168
00:14:30,620 --> 00:14:33,810
Is that possible I can't repay that bit of money?

169
00:14:33,810 --> 00:14:35,830
That's what you boast of whenever and wherever.

170
00:14:35,830 --> 00:14:38,760
Huh, if your son is that impressive,

171
00:14:38,760 --> 00:14:41,100
why are you living like in this way?

172
00:14:41,100 --> 00:14:44,130
If he finds out that his mother isn't paying other's money back,

173
00:14:44,130 --> 00:14:46,040
he the prosecutor must be happy.

174
00:14:46,040 --> 00:14:47,810
Hey, are you finised?

175
00:14:47,810 --> 00:14:51,270
Oho oho, did you just hit me?

176
00:14:51,270 --> 00:14:55,670
You'll be dead. Hey!

177
00:15:00,460 --> 00:15:01,700
What's wrong with you?

178
00:15:01,970 --> 00:15:04,040
- I'm sorry. - Why are you apologizing?

179
00:15:04,040 --> 00:15:05,130
They're the one that should apologize.

180
00:15:05,130 --> 00:15:06,940
Why shoud you nod and bow here?

181
00:15:06,940 --> 00:15:09,480
I'm not going to be submissive any longer.

182
00:15:09,480 --> 00:15:10,940
Let's go back! Go!

183
00:15:11,030 --> 00:15:12,220
Forgive us.

184
00:15:13,140 --> 00:15:14,870
My son's a prosecutor.

185
00:15:14,870 --> 00:15:16,830
Why would I keep eyes upon your bit of money.

186
00:15:17,060 --> 00:15:21,000
Then pay me back now.

187
00:15:21,490 --> 00:15:23,470
Don't lend her any money again.

188
00:15:23,470 --> 00:15:25,050
I have no money to lend her.

189
00:15:25,050 --> 00:15:27,080
She is disturbing all us.

190
00:15:27,080 --> 00:15:29,930
Why's the good to fight as neighbors?

191
00:15:36,240 --> 00:15:37,330
You are here?

192
00:15:41,300 --> 00:15:43,830
Don't nag your mom any more.

193
00:15:46,610 --> 00:15:52,980
Anyway, it's my incapacity to be blamed for your mom's doing.

194
00:15:54,070 --> 00:15:57,860
I might sound old-fashioned,

195
00:16:00,490 --> 00:16:02,240
but this is how I feel.

196
00:16:03,650 --> 00:16:09,300
Only a powerful man could give his woman a happy life.

197
00:16:12,650 --> 00:16:14,840
Don't take my road.

198
00:16:17,730 --> 00:16:18,860
You won't of course.

199
00:16:20,060 --> 00:16:23,220
My son is a prosecutor, he will be fine.

200
00:16:24,530 --> 00:16:25,590
Dad.

201
00:16:26,610 --> 00:16:28,500
You'll be late for work. Hurrry up.

202
00:16:31,220 --> 00:16:35,000
I still can't believe that I have a son like you.

203
00:16:38,240 --> 00:16:39,360
Have a good day.

204
00:17:13,520 --> 00:17:16,570
Excuse me. You can't park here.

205
00:17:18,220 --> 00:17:19,260
Drive away quickly please.

206
00:17:19,740 --> 00:17:20,800
Get it.

207
00:18:16,570 --> 00:18:18,240
Excuse me!

208
00:18:19,300 --> 00:18:24,070
I've to close the door to meet with my daughter.

209
00:18:27,550 --> 00:18:29,930
I meed to meet with your daughter too.

210
00:18:29,930 --> 00:18:33,700
You know Yoo Jung? Do you work with her?

211
00:18:34,980 --> 00:18:37,340
She cann't be back soon.

212
00:18:40,680 --> 00:18:42,350
That's a problem.

213
00:18:46,240 --> 00:18:49,720
Umm. Please take some snacks.

214
00:18:50,490 --> 00:18:52,600
It's made by Yoo Jung.

215
00:18:52,600 --> 00:18:55,090
It's very yummy that would be popular in Japan.

216
00:18:58,570 --> 00:19:01,670
Could you please send a word to Yoo Jung that I'm here to repay my debt.

217
00:19:02,910 --> 00:19:05,110
And I'll be here again.

218
00:19:47,090 --> 00:19:50,170
Excuse me!

219
00:19:51,860 --> 00:19:53,460
Oh! Hi!

220
00:19:54,990 --> 00:19:56,050
What can I do for you?

221
00:19:56,560 --> 00:19:58,630
A man asked me to give you this.

222
00:19:58,630 --> 00:20:00,300
What man?

223
00:20:01,670 --> 00:20:03,680
He is over there.

224
00:20:39,830 --> 00:20:41,250
Dad, try this on.

225
00:20:42,080 --> 00:20:43,240
Again?

226
00:20:45,170 --> 00:20:47,430
Ah, it's hot. Too hot.

227
00:20:48,070 --> 00:20:49,160
Isn't it?

228
00:20:49,980 --> 00:20:52,780
Why are we here in a hot summer day?

229
00:20:52,780 --> 00:20:55,320
Down jackets are supposed to be bought in hot days.

230
00:20:55,670 --> 00:20:58,940
You've been talking about buying a new down jacket for years. Now it's the time.

231
00:21:00,080 --> 00:21:00,980
What do you think?

232
00:21:04,560 --> 00:21:05,990
Is it too thin?

233
00:21:09,080 --> 00:21:10,570
Thank you.

234
00:21:24,220 --> 00:21:25,160
Please have more.

235
00:21:25,160 --> 00:21:27,120
This store has ads on TV shows frequently.

236
00:21:28,260 --> 00:21:29,690
It's a good one.

237
00:21:32,760 --> 00:21:35,470
All the food is the same as long as it enters your stomach.

238
00:21:35,990 --> 00:21:38,840
How much do you pay for those?

239
00:21:42,320 --> 00:21:44,010
Let's go to the movies.

240
00:21:44,010 --> 00:21:46,010
Daddy, Isn't it ages since your last time in a theatre.

241
00:21:46,010 --> 00:21:47,480
Stop behaving like this please.

242
00:21:47,480 --> 00:21:48,130
Sorry?

243
00:21:48,130 --> 00:21:50,840
You don't have to spent money for me. After being married, you would see that life is tougher.

244
00:21:52,850 --> 00:21:53,870
I see.

245
00:21:57,370 --> 00:21:59,260
Do you come to places like this a lot?

246
00:21:59,610 --> 00:22:03,220
It's hard to make money, but easy to spend it.

247
00:22:04,640 --> 00:22:07,530
Could you please stop nagging me if you want to hang out with me again.

248
00:22:07,530 --> 00:22:09,590
I'm not going to buy your blame by my money.

249
00:22:10,400 --> 00:22:14,000
Then go getting married, if you hate my nag.

250
00:22:14,230 --> 00:22:15,830
I will. Don't you worry.

251
00:22:16,360 --> 00:22:18,950
By that time you should date a nice woman.

252
00:22:22,830 --> 00:22:24,540
It's sorrow to see you as a single at this age.

253
00:22:24,540 --> 00:22:26,410
It's sorrow to see you as a single at this age.

254
00:22:26,920 --> 00:22:31,420
Look at Do Hoon. You see man would look handsome after dressing up.

255
00:22:31,420 --> 00:22:32,780
Please hurry up.

256
00:22:33,130 --> 00:22:35,870
After your marriage I'll look for my chance. I need no lessons.

257
00:22:35,870 --> 00:22:38,020
You are the reason for my being single all those years.

258
00:22:38,020 --> 00:22:40,700
I've a job, I own a store.

259
00:22:40,700 --> 00:22:42,890
I'm worse than nobody.

260
00:22:44,530 --> 00:22:45,660
By the way,

261
00:22:45,660 --> 00:22:49,780
some guy came to the store to repay his debt.

262
00:22:49,780 --> 00:22:50,590
Debt?

263
00:22:50,950 --> 00:22:51,950
What debt?

264
00:22:51,950 --> 00:22:54,730
It's about 20000KRW.

265
00:22:55,750 --> 00:22:57,250
What's the collateral?

266
00:22:57,600 --> 00:22:59,350
He said will be back for it.

267
00:23:01,690 --> 00:23:02,690
Hey, you!

268
00:23:02,890 --> 00:23:04,800
Yes, the toll is 8000KRW, please.

269
00:23:04,800 --> 00:23:07,100
And agency fee is 15000KRW.

270
00:23:07,100 --> 00:23:09,990
Aha, you take it as a collateral.

271
00:23:10,710 --> 00:23:12,980
Take a good care of it. I would redeem it back.

272
00:23:14,480 --> 00:23:17,870
It's nothing. Don't worry. Let's move.

273
00:23:36,540 --> 00:23:39,080
Good job. Everyone has done their best.

274
00:23:40,320 --> 00:23:41,670
How is it going?

275
00:23:41,670 --> 00:23:42,720
Yes, chairman.

276
00:23:43,320 --> 00:23:44,310
Let's go!

277
00:23:53,550 --> 00:23:55,440
Money helps you again?

278
00:23:55,440 --> 00:23:59,910
You are here right now. I guess it works.

279
00:24:01,000 --> 00:24:02,620
That's how you treated Ji Hee?

280
00:24:03,750 --> 00:24:06,970
Snatched away everything she had to made her give up?

281
00:24:07,230 --> 00:24:10,840
You think K Corporation is just a street store?

282
00:24:11,460 --> 00:24:14,930
K Corporation is a company with tens of thousands of employees to support.

283
00:24:15,580 --> 00:24:17,860
I'm not energetic enough to care about her.

284
00:24:17,860 --> 00:24:22,400
You knew that she was pregnant with my child.

285
00:24:26,750 --> 00:24:29,390
Why cann't you give me a child that I expect of.

286
00:24:30,120 --> 00:24:33,710
You've been playing around enough.

287
00:24:34,210 --> 00:24:37,090
It's time to win Se Yeon's heart.

288
00:24:37,090 --> 00:24:38,840
You care nothing about my feeling, don't you?

289
00:24:38,840 --> 00:24:40,870
I don't want to repeat what I said.

290
00:24:41,410 --> 00:24:45,590
Who do you think has been paying your expenses all these years?

291
00:24:50,850 --> 00:24:52,600
Can't you think of me as your son for just a moment?

292
00:24:56,280 --> 00:24:59,690
Can't you think of me as your son for just a moment?

293
00:25:21,140 --> 00:25:25,590
Persuade him to keep away from any trouble.

294
00:25:32,210 --> 00:25:33,810
When the project is finished,

295
00:25:33,810 --> 00:25:38,180
we would overlook buildings over there.

296
00:25:39,080 --> 00:25:41,020
You bring me up here to tell me that?

297
00:25:43,090 --> 00:25:44,050
Holy crap.

298
00:25:44,750 --> 00:25:48,040
Your father started from nothing.

299
00:25:48,910 --> 00:25:52,400
He saved me from casino,

300
00:25:52,920 --> 00:25:58,520
helped me get rid of my nasty father and gave me a chance to work for him.

301
00:25:58,520 --> 00:26:01,100
Gwang Min! I'm not interested.

302
00:26:02,120 --> 00:26:04,060
Save your performance to my dad.

303
00:26:06,640 --> 00:26:07,450
Min Hyuk.

304
00:26:08,010 --> 00:26:13,160
Your father has devoted his whole life to his family and company.

305
00:26:13,960 --> 00:26:17,330
You should feel lucky that he is your father, not your opponent.

306
00:26:17,950 --> 00:26:23,120
What a submissive dog dad has kept.

307
00:26:25,220 --> 00:26:26,730
Why so obedient?

308
00:26:33,450 --> 00:26:34,920
Those are Seo Ji Hee's possessions.

309
00:26:37,070 --> 00:26:38,400
How dare you touch them?

310
00:26:38,400 --> 00:26:42,020
Do whatever you want with them.

311
00:26:43,130 --> 00:26:45,220
Dog should act like a dog.

312
00:26:45,220 --> 00:26:47,570
Don't try to interfere with human businesses.

313
00:26:47,830 --> 00:26:51,140
Don't blame your father for what happened to Ji Hee.

314
00:26:52,230 --> 00:26:55,690
You're the one who killed her.

315
00:26:55,690 --> 00:26:56,860
Shut up!

316
00:27:01,630 --> 00:27:02,800
You killed her.

317
00:27:03,460 --> 00:27:05,480
This wouldn't have happened, if you'd let her go earlier.

318
00:27:06,860 --> 00:27:09,080
Now she died with your child.

319
00:27:10,280 --> 00:27:12,740
She at least tried to protect her child.

320
00:27:13,310 --> 00:27:14,630
What did you do?

321
00:27:16,260 --> 00:27:17,600
You are a loser.

322
00:27:18,280 --> 00:27:20,320
You just happen to be born in a rich family.

323
00:27:20,590 --> 00:27:21,650
Shut up!

324
00:27:21,980 --> 00:27:23,220
You want to win?

325
00:27:24,400 --> 00:27:26,630
Then stop hidding away. Return to your home.

326
00:27:26,630 --> 00:27:29,400
What are you crying about if you lack the courage to join the battle?

327
00:27:31,670 --> 00:27:33,100
That's just awful.

328
00:28:07,690 --> 00:28:08,890
Ji Hee!

329
00:28:12,760 --> 00:28:13,690
Ji Hee!

330
00:28:14,200 --> 00:28:15,920
Ji Hee, I'm sorry that I didn't keep my word.

331
00:28:16,570 --> 00:28:19,190
Sorry that I didn't protect you and our baby.

332
00:28:20,970 --> 00:28:24,320
I'll suffer what you suffered and won't love any woman again.

333
00:28:24,320 --> 00:28:26,410
I'll compensate you with my misery.

334
00:28:27,800 --> 00:28:29,190
I promise you.

335
00:28:30,130 --> 00:28:35,270
I'll kick the murder into the hell.

336
00:28:56,260 --> 00:28:57,390
Se Yeon.

337
00:28:59,520 --> 00:29:00,630
What are you doing here?

338
00:29:01,880 --> 00:29:04,050
I'm just here to see you.

339
00:29:06,230 --> 00:29:07,470
Lying again.

340
00:29:08,810 --> 00:29:10,040
You're unbelievable!

341
00:29:11,850 --> 00:29:13,980
You want to die again? Is it why you are here?

342
00:29:18,040 --> 00:29:18,900
No.

343
00:29:20,090 --> 00:29:21,600
I want to live this time.

344
00:29:23,090 --> 00:29:24,800
We are supposed to be blind to each other, aren't we?

345
00:29:26,740 --> 00:29:29,820
I thought I was following my heart.

346
00:29:29,820 --> 00:29:33,820
Yet I just find out what I'm capable of is ordering food in restaurants.

347
00:29:36,140 --> 00:29:37,350
You didn't see it until now?

348
00:29:37,650 --> 00:29:39,930
Nothing's free.

349
00:29:41,080 --> 00:29:44,120
Why don't we take parents' advices as soon as possible?

350
00:29:49,670 --> 00:29:50,810
What are you doing?

351
00:29:50,910 --> 00:29:54,100
Se Yeon, marry me.

352
00:29:56,610 --> 00:30:00,490
I wish I could decide it.

353
00:30:00,490 --> 00:30:01,990
I'll do my best to satisfy your requirements.

354
00:30:01,990 --> 00:30:03,200
Marry me.

355
00:30:05,890 --> 00:30:07,260
Satisfy my requirements?

356
00:30:08,860 --> 00:30:10,660
Such as what?

357
00:30:10,790 --> 00:30:11,810
Freedom.

358
00:30:12,680 --> 00:30:14,740
You've the freedom to do whatever you want to do.

359
00:30:15,170 --> 00:30:16,600
That's what I'll satisfy you with.

360
00:30:16,600 --> 00:30:19,050
Date whoever you want. I won't care.

361
00:30:19,050 --> 00:30:21,800
You don't have to have babies. Just marry me.

362
00:30:21,800 --> 00:30:24,280
When my old man dies, we'll divorce.

363
00:30:27,600 --> 00:30:28,780
Are you crazy?

364
00:30:34,390 --> 00:30:36,570
That's all I have.

365
00:30:37,410 --> 00:30:39,120
I thought I have nothing but money.

366
00:30:39,120 --> 00:30:40,940
But I was wrong.

367
00:30:50,270 --> 00:30:54,290
Se Yeon, please help me out, just once.

368
00:31:06,020 --> 00:31:07,100
Thank you.

369
00:31:13,060 --> 00:31:14,720
Finally.

370
00:31:14,720 --> 00:31:20,010
Now you see who gives you all that you need.

371
00:31:21,070 --> 00:31:22,100
Very well.

372
00:31:22,590 --> 00:31:23,620
Min Hyuk.

373
00:31:24,430 --> 00:31:27,520
How could you ask Min Joo for money?

374
00:31:27,520 --> 00:31:30,020
You should've come to me first.

375
00:31:30,060 --> 00:31:31,740
Do you think it's your money?

376
00:31:32,190 --> 00:31:33,520
It's dad's.

377
00:31:33,520 --> 00:31:34,380
Min Hyuk!

378
00:31:34,380 --> 00:31:37,220
Min Joo, you should be obedient to dad with all your heart.

379
00:31:37,220 --> 00:31:40,060
Once against him, you'll face the doomsday.

380
00:31:40,060 --> 00:31:42,150
You might be kicked off the house naked.

381
00:31:42,500 --> 00:31:44,500
Min Hyuk, he's doing it for your sake.

382
00:31:44,500 --> 00:31:47,770
He's doing it for his company. You cann't see it?

383
00:31:48,370 --> 00:31:50,410
Or you just pretend that you know nothing of it.

384
00:31:53,080 --> 00:31:54,080
Dad.

385
00:31:54,860 --> 00:31:59,150
I'll marry Se Yeon in line with you wish.

386
00:31:59,710 --> 00:32:02,540
Then what's my award from it?

387
00:32:02,540 --> 00:32:03,610
What?

388
00:32:03,610 --> 00:32:08,160
This marriage is a business for you. I think I deserve a share.

389
00:32:09,540 --> 00:32:12,940
Fine. Tell me what you want.

390
00:32:13,640 --> 00:32:16,750
I want the hotel.

391
00:32:17,630 --> 00:32:21,530
Her brother is taking over the casino of the hotel.

392
00:32:21,530 --> 00:32:24,860
And she's taking over the theater in the hotel.

393
00:32:25,670 --> 00:32:27,980
I feel like to give a hand as well.

394
00:32:27,980 --> 00:32:29,850
Min Hyuk, that's just...

395
00:32:30,650 --> 00:32:34,820
Good. Then start from the scratch.

396
00:32:34,820 --> 00:32:37,890
When you are recognized by members of the council,

397
00:32:37,890 --> 00:32:41,060
the hotel is yours.

398
00:32:54,180 --> 00:32:57,630
If there is nothing else, please excuse me.

399
00:32:59,830 --> 00:33:03,110
You might feel down for losing the hotel.

400
00:33:03,960 --> 00:33:05,740
Min Hyuk!

401
00:33:13,670 --> 00:33:15,620
These are the documents of K Corporation.

402
00:33:18,700 --> 00:33:21,950
Have you surveyed Prosecutor Ahn?

403
00:34:00,960 --> 00:34:05,170
Yoo Jung, when I was a middle school student,

404
00:34:05,170 --> 00:34:08,570
my dad had one leg fractured by a folklift

405
00:34:08,570 --> 00:34:11,790
in a demonstration against unfair dismissal.

406
00:34:12,310 --> 00:34:17,220
He was sued for vandalism

407
00:34:20,280 --> 00:34:22,580
before receiving proper medical treatments.

408
00:34:25,430 --> 00:34:32,730
That company dumped dad. Yet mum spent 10 years paying the compensation claimed by it.

409
00:34:34,380 --> 00:34:37,740
I wanted to change it. Yet it's always powerless ones' fault.

410
00:34:37,740 --> 00:34:43,030
And it's rebellious ones' fault as well,

411
00:34:48,310 --> 00:34:52,500
I wanted to show them that everyone is equal in front of the law.

412
00:34:52,500 --> 00:34:55,040
Dear, you can do it.

413
00:34:55,040 --> 00:34:57,940
That's why you've working so hard.

414
00:34:59,130 --> 00:35:08,430
You really think so? Do you think I can make it by framing you?

415
00:35:08,430 --> 00:35:14,950
How could I be so mean?

416
00:35:14,950 --> 00:35:18,100
Dear, it was a tragic accident.

417
00:35:18,100 --> 00:35:20,830
Both for her and for us.

418
00:35:24,260 --> 00:35:32,160
Yoo Jung. Don't you ever regret meeting me?

419
00:35:33,430 --> 00:35:37,740
Not at all. People who have a future never regret.

420
00:35:38,610 --> 00:35:41,050
We have a future, don't we?

421
00:35:43,100 --> 00:35:49,320
Yoo Jung. Sorry.

422
00:35:50,590 --> 00:35:55,480
Stop saying sorry to each other please.

423
00:35:59,190 --> 00:36:03,170
That was an unfortunate accident.

424
00:36:03,870 --> 00:36:08,830
She had no chance to feel regret. We should feel sorry for him.

425
00:38:08,390 --> 00:38:11,490
-Excuse me. Have you seen my dad? -No.

426
00:38:14,210 --> 00:38:16,030
Dad!

427
00:38:22,520 --> 00:38:24,460
Dad!

428
00:38:31,210 --> 00:38:33,180
Dad...

429
00:39:15,120 --> 00:39:22,680
Case number 521. Since Kang Yoo Jung, the defendant of the hit and run case, don't show up for questioning,

430
00:39:22,680 --> 00:39:27,130
this court issues a warrant for her arrest.

431
00:39:44,000 --> 00:39:45,440
Dad.

432
00:39:49,220 --> 00:39:50,330
Why are you here?

433
00:39:50,330 --> 00:39:53,860
Why didn't you tell me where you were going?

434
00:39:53,860 --> 00:39:59,870
Your phone is left at home. I was worried... that something terrible might have happened.

435
00:39:59,870 --> 00:40:02,740
I was so worried!

436
00:40:02,740 --> 00:40:06,770
Relax. I came here because I miss your mother.

437
00:40:37,330 --> 00:40:43,310
Mom. Sorry I haven't been here more often.

438
00:40:49,640 --> 00:40:55,110
It's okay. You're too busy with your wedding.

439
00:41:00,080 --> 00:41:01,810
Have some.

440
00:41:09,800 --> 00:41:12,370
The cream that I made yesterday is really good.

441
00:41:15,320 --> 00:41:19,820
Your mother loved my cream buns.

442
00:41:20,150 --> 00:41:23,300
During the cancer treatment, she vomited what she had,

443
00:41:23,300 --> 00:41:25,620
except my cream buns.

444
00:41:25,880 --> 00:41:30,140
I brought those here and hope you mum could taste them befor they getting cold.

445
00:41:31,490 --> 00:41:37,990
I want her to know that you're getting married with gracious.

446
00:41:39,340 --> 00:41:42,120
You mum held your hands till the last moment.

447
00:41:42,420 --> 00:41:45,010
She cried a lot because she can't accompany you any longer.

448
00:41:53,930 --> 00:42:00,450
Miyeong, don't worry. Our daughter grows well.

449
00:42:02,770 --> 00:42:07,880
Look at her. You should praise me.

450
00:42:19,800 --> 00:42:21,900
-Ms. Kang Yoo Jung. -Dad, please get inside.

451
00:42:21,900 --> 00:42:25,680
-What's going on? -I'll be back.

452
00:42:28,480 --> 00:42:30,900
Ms. Kang, you must know why you're under arrest?

453
00:42:30,900 --> 00:42:34,070
What's going on? What is it, Yoo Jung?

454
00:42:34,490 --> 00:42:37,490
She didn't show up for questioning, so we're here to arrest her.

455
00:42:38,100 --> 00:42:43,340
- You've the right to hire an attorney. And you've the right to remain silent. -Yoo Jung! - Dad!

456
00:42:43,340 --> 00:42:46,730
- Anything said by you from this moment... - Yoo Jung

457
00:42:46,730 --> 00:42:48,610
- might be used as evidence against you in the court. - Yoo Jung

458
00:42:48,610 --> 00:42:51,500
Keep off. Let's go.

459
00:42:51,500 --> 00:43:03,290
Yoo Jung Yoo Jung..Yoo Jung..Yoo Jung..

460
00:43:04,320 --> 00:43:10,270
Dad Dad ..

461
00:43:15,620 --> 00:43:21,740
Dad ..Dad .. Dad ..

462
00:44:19,940 --> 00:44:24,530
Do Hoon, wait a minute. Do Hoon,..suddenly..

463
00:44:24,530 --> 00:44:28,830
- Come this way. - OK, listen...

464
00:44:29,430 --> 00:44:34,540
What? Death? Yoo Jung killed someone?

465
00:44:35,960 --> 00:44:37,570
Is that possible?

466
00:44:37,570 --> 00:44:40,910
It was an accident. She didn't mean to kill her.

467
00:44:44,360 --> 00:44:48,070
- Dad. - No. Something's wrong.

468
00:44:48,070 --> 00:44:52,430
Yoo Jung... Ok, even if she'd hit someone,

469
00:44:52,430 --> 00:44:54,470
she wouldn't have run away like that.

470
00:44:54,470 --> 00:44:57,590
You know that better than me, Do Hoon.

471
00:44:59,720 --> 00:45:03,770
That's not true. They must be mistaken.

472
00:45:04,060 --> 00:45:08,160
I'm going to go and tell them. She didn't do it.

473
00:45:08,160 --> 00:45:13,360
Dad, I'm the prosecutor of Yoo Jung's case.

474
00:45:14,400 --> 00:45:17,610
Thank god. That's good news.

475
00:45:18,050 --> 00:45:22,260
Yes. I'll do whatever to help her.

476
00:45:22,260 --> 00:45:26,370
But if you come to me like this, it won't help Yoo Jung.

477
00:45:29,580 --> 00:45:33,980
If they find out what's going on between Yoo Jung and I, I'll be ruled out from this case.

478
00:45:34,240 --> 00:45:36,320
So you can't come to me.

479
00:45:36,320 --> 00:45:40,650
Then... what should I do?

480
00:45:41,450 --> 00:45:44,780
The best solution is to settle with the victim's family out of court.

481
00:45:44,780 --> 00:45:48,750
Yes, you are right.

482
00:45:59,000 --> 00:46:03,220
Dad. Dad you have to cheer up.

483
00:46:03,220 --> 00:46:08,190
I'll give you my hand behind you, but I can't openly support Yoo Jung.

484
00:46:08,190 --> 00:46:17,300
- I understand. Yoo Jung must be really scared right now - Sorry.

485
00:46:17,300 --> 00:46:21,740
No. No. It's not your fault.

486
00:46:22,290 --> 00:46:26,600
Please take good care of her.

487
00:46:54,650 --> 00:46:58,560
I won't let my personal relationships affect my judgement.

488
00:47:14,080 --> 00:47:18,400
I wonder what he meant by that.

489
00:47:31,770 --> 00:47:33,340
What are you doing here?

490
00:47:33,340 --> 00:47:34,990
I told you.

491
00:47:35,610 --> 00:47:39,480
I'm here to make sure that laws are fully applied.

492
00:47:40,530 --> 00:47:42,670
We are conducting investigations with all efforts.

493
00:47:42,670 --> 00:47:44,570
Please don't worry. You could be back right now.

494
00:47:46,340 --> 00:47:48,300
I was not intended to worry about it.

495
00:47:48,300 --> 00:47:51,110
I don't know why I'm so worried.

496
00:47:52,910 --> 00:47:55,390
I guess it's because our prosecutor has to refresh himself with crappy coffee.

497
00:47:55,390 --> 00:47:57,390
Why are you so tired? Because you were working late?

498
00:47:57,390 --> 00:48:04,570
Or because I should have given you a car.

499
00:48:07,450 --> 00:48:10,720
Prosecutor, I heard that you've a lover?

500
00:48:11,760 --> 00:48:14,750
Maybe you didn't mention it.

501
00:48:14,750 --> 00:48:17,060
What's your point?

502
00:48:19,200 --> 00:48:25,050
What kind of love deserves to be called true love?

503
00:48:25,940 --> 00:48:29,700
I thought Ji Hee and I was in deep love,

504
00:48:29,700 --> 00:48:33,700
but people told me that wasn't love.

505
00:48:34,900 --> 00:48:37,450
I love her, truely.

506
00:48:39,420 --> 00:48:43,490
So I'm going to prove it to her

507
00:48:43,490 --> 00:48:46,400
how much I love her.

508
00:48:47,170 --> 00:48:49,180
I'll wait and see.

509
00:48:50,820 --> 00:48:53,470
I'm watching you, Prosecutor Ahn.

510
00:49:28,180 --> 00:49:30,280
Open her cuffs, please.

511
00:49:48,910 --> 00:49:49,580
Prosecutor.

512
00:49:49,580 --> 00:49:50,910
Ms. Kang.

513
00:49:51,830 --> 00:49:54,240
There is no evidence to prove your innocence till now.

514
00:49:54,240 --> 00:49:56,600
There is no evidence to prove your innocence till now.

515
00:49:56,600 --> 00:50:01,140
Are you still pleading not guilty?

516
00:50:01,140 --> 00:50:03,780
Something is wrong about dad.

517
00:50:04,800 --> 00:50:07,680
Answer my question please.

518
00:50:07,940 --> 00:50:11,830
Dad hasn't come to see me.

519
00:50:11,830 --> 00:50:13,320
Not even once.

520
00:50:13,320 --> 00:50:16,360
That doesn't like him.

521
00:50:16,360 --> 00:50:20,460
He said he's been having bad headaches recently. Prosecutor.

522
00:50:20,460 --> 00:50:24,950
Admit your guilt, anyway.

523
00:50:24,950 --> 00:50:28,710
And apologize to the victim's family please.

524
00:50:28,710 --> 00:50:32,170
If you admit your crime, the court will grant you a clemency.

525
00:50:34,410 --> 00:50:37,480
I understand.

526
00:50:38,330 --> 00:50:40,200
I don't care what will fall upon me.

527
00:50:40,200 --> 00:50:43,550
And I'm really sorry for that tragedy.

528
00:50:43,550 --> 00:50:47,410
I'm sorry for the death.

529
00:50:47,410 --> 00:50:51,400
But I...

530
00:50:51,400 --> 00:50:53,550
I'm worried about my dad.

531
00:50:54,310 --> 00:50:56,780
I think he's really sick.

532
00:50:56,780 --> 00:50:59,670
I couldn't take him to a doctor.

533
00:50:59,670 --> 00:51:01,880
Prosecutor. Prosector.

534
00:51:01,880 --> 00:51:04,200
Kang Yoo Jung.

535
00:51:04,200 --> 00:51:06,310
Are you guilty?

536
00:51:06,310 --> 00:51:07,440
Dad must be sick severely.

537
00:51:07,440 --> 00:51:08,250
Ms. Kang Yoo Jung!

538
00:51:08,250 --> 00:51:10,850
My dad is sick!

539
00:51:10,850 --> 00:51:14,410
Kang Yoo Jung, look at this.

540
00:51:25,680 --> 00:51:30,220
Don't worry. I'll take care of him.

541
00:51:36,910 --> 00:51:39,950
Come in. Have a seat.

542
00:51:40,270 --> 00:51:44,690
What are you talking about?

543
00:51:44,690 --> 00:51:48,270
A hit and run? People died?

544
00:51:48,270 --> 00:51:51,640
Yoo Jung...

545
00:51:52,470 --> 00:51:55,730
I come to you because...

546
00:51:57,150 --> 00:51:59,170
I've little savings in hand.

547
00:51:59,170 --> 00:52:01,010
So I want to borrow some from you.

548
00:52:01,010 --> 00:52:03,160
In order to settle the case out of court,

549
00:52:03,160 --> 00:52:05,730
I've to prepare a large sum of money.

550
00:52:05,730 --> 00:52:08,550
Does Do Hoon know this?

551
00:52:08,550 --> 00:52:13,410
He told me to reconciliate with the victim's family.

552
00:52:24,240 --> 00:52:25,600
Take this.

553
00:52:25,600 --> 00:52:29,150
I'll try to collect the rest.

554
00:52:29,150 --> 00:52:29,660
Er...

555
00:52:29,660 --> 00:52:31,030
You said Yoo Jung was in jail.

556
00:52:31,030 --> 00:52:32,380
We have to bail her immediately.

557
00:52:32,380 --> 00:52:35,710
How could a young lady stayed in jail?

558
00:52:35,710 --> 00:52:38,940
She is right. Please take it.

559
00:52:38,940 --> 00:52:41,200
I'll go around to see what I can do.

560
00:52:41,200 --> 00:52:44,100
It'll be okay.

561
00:52:44,900 --> 00:52:48,480
Thank you. I'm going to beg for pardon.

562
00:52:48,480 --> 00:52:51,490
Ok. Take it easy please.

563
00:52:51,960 --> 00:52:53,260
Thank you.

564
00:52:54,040 --> 00:52:55,560
We are family.

565
00:53:02,750 --> 00:53:07,040
No wander they are a bit queer recently.

566
00:53:10,680 --> 00:53:13,580
You just impressed me.

567
00:53:13,580 --> 00:53:17,560
With so much money, they can complain no more I guess.

568
00:53:18,620 --> 00:53:20,200
She hit and ran?

569
00:53:20,200 --> 00:53:21,700
Does she mean to ruin everyone?

570
00:53:21,700 --> 00:53:24,690
Could she think like a normal man?

571
00:53:24,690 --> 00:53:25,400
Dear!

572
00:53:25,400 --> 00:53:28,410
Stop defending her. She's a murder!

573
00:53:28,410 --> 00:53:30,510
Don't you know what Do Hoon's job is?

574
00:53:30,510 --> 00:53:34,070
His job is to defend the dead ones.

575
00:54:26,510 --> 00:54:28,090
I beg you accept it.

576
00:54:34,780 --> 00:54:39,230
Madam, Yoo Jung was brought up by myself.

577
00:54:39,230 --> 00:54:43,570
Her mother died when she was five.

578
00:54:43,570 --> 00:54:46,170
After that I raised her all alone.

579
00:54:46,170 --> 00:54:49,440
I could understand all your feelings.

580
00:54:50,470 --> 00:54:51,990
Sorry.

581
00:54:54,470 --> 00:54:57,120
I know no matter how many times I keel to beg your pardon,

582
00:54:57,120 --> 00:55:00,650
our sin could never be washed away.

583
00:55:00,650 --> 00:55:03,300
Your daughter lost her life.

584
00:55:04,030 --> 00:55:06,850
She was so young.

585
00:55:07,490 --> 00:55:10,650
I konw nothing could compensate your loss.

586
00:55:11,170 --> 00:55:15,880
Sorry. Sorry.

587
00:55:20,240 --> 00:55:25,620
I'am willing to do anything if you agree to settle it out of court.

588
00:55:25,620 --> 00:55:29,700
She's getting married soon.

589
00:55:29,700 --> 00:55:30,800
Please give her a chance.

590
00:55:30,800 --> 00:55:32,650
After your daughter killed my daughter,

591
00:55:32,650 --> 00:55:35,800
you ask me to keep her alive?

592
00:55:37,520 --> 00:55:42,820
You are a parent too. You brought up a girl as well.

593
00:55:42,820 --> 00:55:45,660
You want me to forgive my daughter's murder?

594
00:55:45,660 --> 00:55:46,580
I'm sorry, I...

595
00:55:46,580 --> 00:55:53,380
My poor daughter lay on the cold road for hours and hours,

596
00:55:53,380 --> 00:55:59,660
because your precious daughter ran away after hitting her.

597
00:56:00,620 --> 00:56:04,570
As long as I think of how Ji Hee died,

598
00:56:04,570 --> 00:56:09,390
I would rather tear up the murder into pieces.

599
00:56:09,390 --> 00:56:12,510
Now you want to settle it?

600
00:56:13,620 --> 00:56:15,390
All those stuffs are meaningless.

601
00:56:15,870 --> 00:56:19,240
No matter how many you bring here, I won't give you the permission.

602
00:56:19,240 --> 00:56:23,390
No matter what you bring here,

603
00:56:23,390 --> 00:56:24,630
I won't settle it in private.

604
00:56:24,630 --> 00:56:28,730
Leave here with all your money.

605
00:56:28,730 --> 00:56:32,090
You bring back my daughter.

606
00:57:44,610 --> 00:57:47,140
All rise!

607
00:57:51,950 --> 00:57:53,270
Be seated!

608
00:58:00,470 --> 00:58:05,820
Now the Seoul District Court holds a criminal trial.

609
00:58:06,210 --> 00:58:11,710
Case number 521. A hit-and-run.

610
00:58:11,710 --> 00:58:15,790
Please step forward, Kang Yoo Jung the defendant.

611
00:58:40,430 --> 00:58:44,980
Do Hoon, do you remember the day we met?

612
00:58:44,980 --> 00:58:47,600
I waited for you at the bus stop

613
00:58:47,600 --> 00:58:50,800
after you left by bus,

614
00:58:50,800 --> 00:58:54,140
because I got a hunch that you would return for me.

615
00:58:54,470 --> 00:58:57,090
After 10 minutes or so,

616
00:58:57,090 --> 00:59:00,450
you rushed back.

617
00:59:00,450 --> 00:59:03,910
Of course I remember.

618
00:59:03,910 --> 00:59:07,120
I was not sure why I would run back.

619
00:59:07,120 --> 00:59:12,420
I just thought you might be waiting for me.

620
00:59:12,950 --> 00:59:19,170
Don't worry, I'm always here.

621
00:59:19,170 --> 00:59:21,830
No rush is needed.

622
00:59:21,830 --> 00:59:24,890
Just walk to me and take me away as you did.

623
00:59:54,990 --> 00:59:58,200
Kang Yoo Jung's irresponsible act

624
00:59:58,200 --> 01:00:00,750
took the life of a young woman

625
01:00:00,750 --> 01:00:05,670
and an unborn baby.

626
01:00:05,670 --> 01:00:10,790
This, under no circumstance, is excusable.

627
01:00:12,040 --> 01:00:14,750
Therefore, as the prosecutor,

628
01:00:14,750 --> 01:00:26,560
I sentence Kang Yoo Jung to jail for 5 years.

629
01:00:46,200 --> 01:00:48,500
Good work, prosecutor Ahn.

630
01:00:49,080 --> 01:00:51,960
Actually you did better than I expected.

631
01:00:51,960 --> 01:00:57,420
Put aside any personal feelings, and follow the law.

632
01:00:57,780 --> 01:00:59,790
Am I talking too much?

633
01:01:00,620 --> 01:01:03,730
What's your point on earth?

634
01:01:11,000 --> 01:01:12,110
Ahn Do Hoon is speaking.

635
01:01:12,110 --> 01:01:15,550
This is hospital. Do you know Mr. Kang Woo Chul?

636
01:01:59,120 --> 01:02:01,730
No. 2008, get in!

637
01:02:30,840 --> 01:02:35,790
Hey! Get up.

638
01:02:40,710 --> 01:02:43,040
Why are you here?

639
01:02:44,000 --> 01:02:45,930
Introduce yourself. It's the rule.

640
01:02:45,930 --> 01:02:47,440
How many times have you been here?

641
01:02:47,440 --> 01:02:48,510
Excuse me?

642
01:02:48,510 --> 01:02:51,960
She committed hit and run. Someone died.

643
01:02:54,730 --> 01:02:57,960
You killed people.

644
01:02:57,960 --> 01:02:59,520
What do you want?

645
01:02:59,520 --> 01:03:03,980
Shut up.

646
01:03:06,890 --> 01:03:07,950
Do it!

647
01:03:08,530 --> 01:03:10,810
Beat her.

648
01:03:43,750 --> 01:03:48,440
One, two, three, four, five, six, seven, eight.

649
01:03:48,440 --> 01:03:54,040
One, two, three, four, five, six, seven, eight.

650
01:03:54,040 --> 01:03:59,510
One, two, three, four, five, six, seven, eight.

651
01:04:07,320 --> 01:04:09,110
Stop! Stop!

652
01:04:09,110 --> 01:04:10,050
How is she?

653
01:04:10,050 --> 01:04:10,590
What's it?

654
01:04:10,590 --> 01:04:12,070
2008 2008

655
01:04:12,070 --> 01:04:15,440
Wake up, 2008, 2008.

656
01:04:15,440 --> 01:04:21,560
2008 2008 2008

657
01:04:26,040 --> 01:04:27,950
Is your menstruation normal?

658
01:04:29,740 --> 01:04:32,680
When was the last time of it?

659
01:04:33,320 --> 01:04:34,810
Excuse me?

660
01:04:35,570 --> 01:04:39,390
You didn't know you were pregnant?

661
01:04:39,880 --> 01:04:43,780
Are you a blockhead?

662
01:04:44,230 --> 01:04:47,310
Do you have anyone to contact with?

663
01:04:50,530 --> 01:04:52,340
What?

664
01:04:56,110 --> 01:05:00,320
Kang Yoo Jung is pregnant?

665
01:05:04,680 --> 01:05:07,200
It's getting interesting.

666
01:05:33,610 --> 01:05:36,500
Push harder!

667
01:05:36,500 --> 01:05:39,400
Good! I can see the head.

668
01:05:39,400 --> 01:05:41,610
It's almost done.

669
01:05:58,490 --> 01:06:00,070
Look.

670
01:06:32,460 --> 01:06:33,210
Next on Secret Love

671
01:06:33,210 --> 01:06:34,360
Leave.

672
01:06:34,360 --> 01:06:37,980
Do Hoon, he's a big boy now.

673
01:06:37,980 --> 01:06:40,820
San, say thank you.

674
01:06:40,820 --> 01:06:41,750
Say it.

675
01:06:41,750 --> 01:06:44,430
You know she is releasing soon.

676
01:06:44,430 --> 01:06:46,650
You have a parole review next week. Be a good girl.

677
01:06:46,650 --> 01:06:48,310
2008, the defendant of the hit and run case.

678
01:06:48,310 --> 01:06:50,810
Even a prosecutor would corrupt?

679
01:06:50,810 --> 01:06:52,090
What do you want from me?

680
01:06:52,090 --> 01:06:53,140
Leave her.

681
01:06:53,140 --> 01:06:56,920
Just stay in the jail, forever.

682
01:06:56,920 --> 01:06:59,850
You would be a trouble once you are out.

683
01:06:59,850 --> 01:07:02,700
Please welcome Jo Min Hyuk, the new chairman.

684
01:07:05,370 --> 01:07:06,840
Take him away.

685
01:07:07,650 --> 01:07:08,320
No!

686
01:07:08,320 --> 01:07:09,990
Yoo Jung!

687
01:07:09,990 --> 01:07:11,690
You can't!

688
01:07:11,690 --> 01:07:13,920
Don't, please.
